#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.concat.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.concat"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.merge.concat.concat:1 of
msgid "Concatenate LiteFrame objects along a particular axis."
msgstr "沿特定轴连接 LiteFrame 对象。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.merge.concat.concat:3 of
msgid ""
"Stacks inputs vertically (``axis=0``) or side-by-side (``axis=1``). "
"``None`` entries are dropped; for ``axis=0`` the union of physical "
"columns is produced (missing columns null-filled, like "
"``pandas.concat(..., join='outer')``); for ``axis=1`` all inputs must "
"share identical row ``nsplits`` (LiteFrame rechunk is not yet supported),"
" and a physical column name duplicated across inputs is rejected. Virtual"
" range columns stay virtual when their ranges are contiguous (``axis=0``)"
" or carried by a single input (``axis=1``); non-contiguous range columns "
"(``axis=0``) are materialized, and a range column carried by more than "
"one input (``axis=1``) is rejected."
msgstr ""
"垂直堆叠输入（``axis=0``）或并排拼接（``axis=1``）。``None`` 条目会被丢弃"
"；对于 ``axis=0`` 生成物理列的并集（缺失列用空值填充，类似于 ``pandas."
"concat(..., join='outer')``）；对于 ``axis=1`` 所有输入必须共享相同的行 `"
"`nsplits``（LiteFrame 重新分块尚未支持），并且跨输入重复的物理列名会被"
"拒绝。当虚拟范围列连续时（``axis=0``）或由单个输入承载时（``axis=1``），"
"它们保持虚拟状态；非连续范围列（``axis=0``）会被实例化，由多个输入承载的"
"范围列（``axis=1``）会被拒绝。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.merge.concat.concat of
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.merge.concat.concat:14 of
msgid "LiteFrame objects to concatenate. ``None`` entries are silently dropped."
msgstr "要连接的 LiteFrame 对象。``None`` 条目会静默丢弃。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.merge.concat.concat:17 of
msgid ""
"Axis to concatenate along. ``0`` stacks rows vertically; ``1`` glues "
"columns side-by-side."
msgstr "连接所沿的轴。``0`` 垂直堆叠行；``1`` 并排拼接列。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.merge.concat.concat of
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.merge.concat.concat:21 of
msgid ""
"A new lazy LiteFrame containing the concatenated data. Call "
"``.execute()`` to materialize the results."
msgstr "包含连接数据的新懒加载 LiteFrame。调用 ``.execute()`` 来实例化结果。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.merge.concat.concat of
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.merge.concat.concat:27 of
msgid ":py:obj:`merge`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.merge.concat.concat:28 of
msgid "Merge LiteFrame with another LiteFrame using a database-style join."
msgstr "使用数据库风格的连接将 LiteFrame 与另一个 LiteFrame 合并。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.merge.concat.concat:31 of
msgid "示例"
msgstr ""

